              Questions? Reply to this email<% if (settings.storePhone) { %> or call <%= settings.storePhone %><% } %>.
            </p>
            <p style="margin:0; font-size:11px; line-height:1.6; color:<%= c.muted %>;">
              <%= brand.name %><% if (config.footer && config.footer.copyright) { %> · <%= config.footer.copyright.replace('© ', '') %><% } %>
            </p>
          </td>
        </tr>
      </table>
    </td></tr>
